00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:09.020
Matt: This was a slow process.

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:21.330
It would have started about '96 when I
was at uni and some friends suggested it.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.730
It started to get suggested a
bit more frequently around 2000.

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:33.330
And I remember asking mental health
professionals during periods of depression

00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:38.289
and anxiety about it as far back as 2005.

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:45.479
But, yeah, I didn't really seriously
start approaching mental health

00:00:45.479 --> 00:00:51.149
professionals about it until about 2015.

00:00:52.049 --> 00:00:55.499
Diagnosis came through 20...

00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:58.919
autumn of 2016.

00:01:00.389 --> 00:01:09.164
This was quite a lengthy process
because I went to my GP, I think early

00:01:09.164 --> 00:01:14.505
2015 and was initially turned away.

00:01:16.065 --> 00:01:22.535
But went back and went home and thought
about it some more and gathered some

00:01:22.535 --> 00:01:27.455
more evidence, both from online tests
and from what friends had told me and

00:01:27.755 --> 00:01:34.324
about issues that I experienced in work
and socialising in general, went back

00:01:34.324 --> 00:01:42.089
to the GP  and said to them, "look,
here's, here's some more evidence.

00:01:42.929 --> 00:01:46.140
I know you, you say that you
don't want to put a label on it.

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:47.940
You say that it's likely to be expensive.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:53.699
You say that I'm going to have to go out
of area, but I'm, I'm not going away.

00:01:54.389 --> 00:01:57.070
I'm going to keep going back
until I get this referral".

00:01:57.700 --> 00:02:00.449
And so they offered me the referral.

00:02:00.479 --> 00:02:04.110
I'm in Manchester, central area.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:11.790
I think there are two nearby one
is - two two adult autism referral

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:20.859
services - one is in Trafford and
one is, I don't know, Bolton, Oldham.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:25.410
It's somewhere elsewhere
outside of the city.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:29.880
And they all have long waiting lists.

00:02:30.704 --> 00:02:34.905
So I was eventually put on
the waiting list for Trafford.

00:02:34.935 --> 00:02:40.335
And then there was I think,
I think it's three stages.

00:02:40.335 --> 00:02:46.995
There was certainly two or three
interviews as part of that process.

00:02:46.995 --> 00:02:50.115
And then they went off and met
with their team and eventually

00:02:51.315 --> 00:02:52.935
